Primary reference: https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/packet.7.html
Exact upstream stable source: https://github.com/gregkh/linux/blob/v6.12.115/net/packet/af_packet.c
packet_create registers nonzero protocols immediately; protocol zero waits for bind.
packet_do_bind changes the registered device/protocol without purging the receive queue.
packet_recvmsg dequeues the stored skb and returns its original link-layer metadata.
